---
// Orijinal Aksesuar — /neden-orijinal/orijinal-aksesuar. Fourth page of
// the "Neden Orijinal" series (see header.data.ts's brandsMega second
// column), following Güvenilir Teknoloji, Uzun Ömürlü Cihazlar and
// Yaygın Servis Ağı. Same trust/authenticity content genre — this page's
// own angle is the everyday consumable/fit accessories (kulak ucu,
// cerumen filtresi, pil, şarj, streaming aksesuarları) rather than
// structural spare parts (Uzun Ömürlü Cihazlar) or the service network
// itself (Yaygın Servis Ağı). Built on the same master templates and
// shared, data-driven components used throughout the session (same
// KulakArkasiComparison component, already generic, reused as-is), with
// every section reframed around accessory authenticity rather than
// hearing health:
//
// - The "candidacy"/"symptom" slot becomes the sıkça görülen sonuçları
//   of non-original accessory use (sound-quality loss, ear irritation,
//   battery/charging incompatibility, physical damage, hygiene issues).
// - "Dikkat Edilmesi Gerekenler" covers practical accessory-shopping
//   caveats (model-specific compatibility, filter-change cadence,
//   warranty risk) rather than a health-safety warning — no
//   self-diagnosis disclaimer here, same as the three prior pages.
// - The TechEvolution "stage" slot becomes a 4-step accessory-renewal
//   process (model tespiti -> aksesuar seçimi -> yetkili temin ->
//   düzenli değişim) instead of a severity ladder or a different
//   process for another subject.
// - The KulakArkasiComparison table compares original accessories
//   against generic/third-party ones — this page's own natural
//   comparison axis.
//
// accentColor: eflatun / violet-600 (#7c3aed) — fourth color in the
// fresh accent rotation opened for this series on Güvenilir Teknoloji's
// hero.ts; see that file for the full rationale.
//
// 14-section flow, in order: Hero -> Nedir? + Neden Önemlidir? ->
// Uyumsuz Aksesuarın Sıkça Görülen Sonuçları -> Avantajları -> Dikkat
// Edilmesi Gerekenler -> Aksesuar Yenileme Adımları -> Öne Çıkan
// Aksesuarlar -> Teknolojiler -> Markalara Göre İnceleyin -> Orijinal vs
// Jenerik Aksesuar -> Uzman Yorumu -> SSS -> Premium CTA -> İlgili
// İçerikler.
import MainLayout from "../../layouts/MainLayout.astro";
import BrandPageHero from "../../components/brand-page/BrandPageHero/BrandPageHero.astro";
import BrandPageIntro from "../../components/brand-page/BrandPageIntro/BrandPageIntro.astro";
import BrandPageIdealUser from "../../components/brand-page/BrandPageIdealUser/BrandPageIdealUser.astro";
